{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"spell_mending_bloom","model_identifier":"spell_mending_bloom","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# spell_mending_bloom\n\nGrovesinger mending bloom: a patch of flowers springing up in a circle (radius 40 u, 2.3 m across) round the healed allies.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -45..45, y 0..7, z -45..45 units (2.52 x 0.21 x 2.52 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 64 x 64, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 148.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 90 x 7 x 90 (w x h x d), centred at x 0, z 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `bloom` | 0.8 | once | the flowers spring up out of the ground with a turn and settle |\n| `fade` | 0.8 | once | flowers sink back into the ground |\n\n- Glowing cubes (`glow_*`): glow_heart0, glow_heart1, glow_heart10, glow_heart11, glow_heart12, glow_heart13, glow_heart14, glow_heart15, glow_heart16, glow_heart17, glow_heart18, glow_heart19 ...\n\n## Notes\n\n- Bright simple glowing shapes; every lit cube is named `glow_*` (flat colours; the game may scale, spin and fade them). No particles or lights in the file.\n"},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":64},"elements":[{"name":"stem0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[13.1841,0.0,2.9869],"to":[13.9841,4.0,3.7869],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[34.1841,19.0,34.9841,23.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[4.9869,19.0,5.7869,23.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[34.1841,19.0,34.9841,23.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[4.9869,19.0,5.7869,23.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[16.1841,